th></svg>Reject application</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8 w-full" type="button" disabled="" title="Coming soon (Phase 2)" aria-disabled="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square me-2 h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>Request more info</button><hr class="border-[var(--lc-border)]"><p style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);" class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Approving creates a membership immediately and notifies the applicant. Rejecting sends a message with your reason.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>
