ll bg-[var(--lc-accent-bold)] outline outline-1 outline-[var(--lc-accent-bold-edge)]"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 top-3 bottom-0 mx-auto w-0.5" style="background: var(--lc-accent-bold-edge);"></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-start"><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">Decided</p><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data mt-0.5 block text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">06 Sept 2026, 10:00</span></div></li><li class="relative flex min-h-[var(--lc-space-2xl)] gap-[var(--lc-space-md)] pb-[var(--lc-space-md)] last:pb-0" data-rec-timeline-state="complete"><div class="relative flex w-3 shrink-0 flex-col items-center"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative z-[1] block h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[var(--lc-accent-bold)] outline outline-1 outline-[var(--lc-accent-bold-edge)]"></span></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-start"><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">Approved</p><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data mt-0.5 block text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">06 Sept 2026, 10:00</span></div></li></ol><article class="rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] p-[var(--lc-space-lg)] shadow-[var(--lc-elevation-sm)]" aria-label="Message from Nadia Owner, Owner, decided 06 Sept 2026, 10:00"><header class="mb-[var(--lc-space-md)] flex flex-wrap items-center gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><span class="relative flex shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full h-8 w-8"><span class="flex h-full w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] text-[var(--lc-text-heading)] text-xs">NO</span></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-start"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-[var(--lc-space-xs)]"><span class="truncate text-[var(--lc-text-heading)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">Nadia Owner</span><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-pill border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] border-[var(--lc-border)] rounded-pill">Owner</div></div></div><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data ms-auto text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">06 Sept 2026, 10:00</span></header><div role="article" class="text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body-lg);"><p class="mb-[var(--lc-space-sm)] last:mb-0">Welcome to Elite.</p></div></article><div class="space-y-[var(--lc-space-sm)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);"><p>You'll join as <strong>Agent</strong> with the <strong>Standard</strong> capability pack.</p><p>This is a non-exclusive affiliation. Your personal workspace stays independent; you can be with other agencies at the same time.</p><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">When you switch, this browser will land in Elite Real Estate until you switch back via the workspace menu.</p></div><p class="pb-[var(--lc-space-xl)] text-center"><a class="text-[var(--lc-text-brand)] underline-offset-2 hover:underline" style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);" href="/support?context=application&amp;id=app_01">Something not right? Contact WingCaster support</a></p></div><aside class="hidden lg:sticky lg:top-[var(--lc-space-3xl)] lg:block lg:space-y-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)] max-w-none" data-rec-cta-layout="stacked"><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 min-h-tap text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] w-full justify-center" type="button">Decline this offer</button><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 min-h-tap w-full justify-center" type="button">View agency profile</button><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8 min-h-tap w-full justify-center" type="button">Switch to Elite Real Estate workspace</button></div><div class="rounded-[var(--lc-radius-lg)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] p-[var(--lc-space-md)]"><p class="text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">When you accept, your workspace switches to Elite Real Estate. Your personal tenant remains, but this browser will land in Elite Real Estate until you switch back via the tenant menu.</p></div><dl class="space-y-[var(--lc-space-2xs)] text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);"><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Application ID</dt><dd data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data font-mono" dir="ltr">app_01</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Applied</dt><dd data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">05 Sept 2026, 09:14</dd></div><div class="flex justify-between gap-2"><dt>Decided</dt><dd data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">06 Sept 2026, 10:00</dd></div></dl></aside></div><div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-sticky border-t border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface-raised)] px-[var(--lc-space-md)] pt-[var(--lc-space-sm)] shadow-[var(--lc-elevation-md)] lg:hidden pb-[max(var(--lc-space-sm),env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px))]"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)] mx-auto max-w-none" data-rec-cta-layout="stacked"><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 min-h-tap text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] w-full justify-center" type="button">Decline this offer</button><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap px-4 py-2 min-h-tap w-full justify-center" type="button">View agency profile</button><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8 min-h-tap w-full justify-center" type="button">Switch to Elite Real Estate workspace</button></div></div></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>
