)] ease-[var(--lc-easing-out)]"></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">Sign in to submit your application — or expand guest signup above.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" for=":rq:-message" style="font: var(--lc-type-overline);">Message to the agency</label><p id="__stable__" class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">Tell them why you'd like to join — what you specialize in, where you sell most, and what you're looking for in an agency.</p><textarea id="__stable__" rows="4" maxlength="500" disabled="" placeholder="I've been selling residential in Dubai Marina for 3 years…" aria-describedby="__stable__" class="min-h-[7rem] w-full rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] px-3 py-2 text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] placeholder:text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] disabled:opacity-50" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);"></textarea><div class="flex justify-end gap-2"><span id="__stable__" class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);"><span data-lc-numeric="true" class="lc-data">0</span> / 500</span><span class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></span></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" for=":rq:-listings" style="font: var(--lc-type-overline);">How many active listings do you have today?</label><p id="__stable__" class="text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">Approximate is fine.</p><input type="number" inputmode="numeric" data-lc-numeric="" class="flex min-h-tap w-full rounded-md border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] focus-visible:outline-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 max-w-[12rem] font-[family-name:var(--lc-font-mono)] tabular-nums" id="__stable__" min="0" max="500" dir="ltr" disabled="" aria-describedby="__stable__" value=""></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" for=":rq:-portfolio" style="font: var(--lc-type-overline);">Portfolio or profile link (optional)</label><input type="url" inputmode="url" class="flex min-h-tap w-full rounded-md border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium placeholder:text-[var(--lc-text-muted)] focus-visible:outline-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50" id="__stable__" dir="ltr" disabled="" placeholder="https://instagram.com/your.handle" value=""></div><fieldset class="border-0 p-0"><legend class="mb-2 text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-overline);">When can you start?</legend><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="When can you start?" class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap"><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] px-3 border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] opacity-50"><input type="radio" name=":rq:-availability" disabled="" class="sr-only" value="immediately"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">Immediately</span></label><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] px-3 border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] opacity-50"><input type="radio" name=":rq:-availability" disabled="" class="sr-only" value="within_2_weeks"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">Within 2 weeks</span></label><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] px-3 border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] opacity-50"><input type="radio" name=":rq:-availability" disabled="" class="sr-only" value="within_a_month"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">Within a month</span></label><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] px-3 border border-[var(--lc-border)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] opacity-50"><input type="radio" name=":rq:-availability" disabled="" class="sr-only" value="just_exploring"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">Just exploring</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70 text-[var(--lc-text-secondary)]" for=":rq:-referral" style="font: var(--lc-type-overline);">Where did you hear about Elite Real Estate?</label><select id="__stable__" disabled="" class="min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] w-full rounded-[var(--lc-radius-md)] border border-[var(--lc-border-strong)] bg-[var(--lc-surface)] px-3 text-[var(--lc-text-primary)]"><option value="">Select a source (optional)</option><option value="bazaar">WingCaster Bazaar</option><option value="olx">OLX</option><option value="property_finder">Property Finder</option><option value="instagram">Instagram</option><option value="referral">Referral from a friend</option><option value="direct">Direct link</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="mt-[var(--lc-space-sm)] flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)]"><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-start gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 accent-[var(--lc-action-primary)]"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">I agree to WingCaster's <a href="/terms" class="text-[var(--lc-text-brand)] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Terms of Service</a> and <a href="/privacy" class="text-[var(--lc-text-brand)] underline-offset-2 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Required.</span></span></label><label class="flex min-h-[var(--lc-tap-target-min)] cursor-pointer items-start gap-2"><input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 accent-[var(--lc-action-primary)]"><span style="font: var(--lc-type-body-sm);">I consent to sharing my WingCaster profile (name, contact, existing listings) with Elite Real Estate for the purpose of this application.<span class="ms-1 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]">Required.</span><span class="mt-1 block text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);">The agency sees only what they need to review your application. They can't act on your account.</span></span></label></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)] md:flex-row md:justify-end"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap text-[var(--lc-text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8 w-full md:w-auto" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-primary)] text-[var(--lc-action-primary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-action-primary-hover)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8 w-full md:w-auto" type="submit" disabled="">Submit application →</button></div></form></div><footer class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-[var(--lc-text-muted)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-caption);"><p>Applications typically get a response within 2 business days.</p><p>You'll be notified by email and in the WingCaster app.</p><p>Elite Real Estate may contact you directly to schedule a call.</p></footer></div></main></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>
<!-- portals -->
"
`;

