ter gap-2" style="font: var(--lc-type-heading-2);"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span><span>Elite Real Estate isn't accepting new applications right now</span></h2><p class="mt-[var(--lc-space-sm)]" style="font: var(--lc-type-body);">The agency has paused new applications. You can still explore other agencies on WingCaster.</p><div class="mt-[var(--lc-space-lg)] flex flex-col gap-[var(--lc-space-sm)] sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow] duration-fast ease-out focus-visible:outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 min-h-tap bg-[var(--lc-action-secondary)] text-[var(--lc-action-secondary-text)] hover:bg-[var(--lc-surface-sunken)] min-h-tap rounded-md px-8" href="/agencies">Browse other agencies →</a></div></div></main></div><div role="region" aria-label="Notifications (F8)" tabindex="-1" style="pointer-events: none;"><ol tabindex="-1" class="fixed top-0 z-toast flex max-w-[420px] flex-col gap-2 p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]"></ol></div>
